&lt;p style="margin-left: 8px; line-height: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 8px; text-align: left"&gt;新株予約権のうち自己新株予約権の数&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 408px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 8px; line-height: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 8px; text-align: left"&gt;－&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 24.87px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 232px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 8px; line-height: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 8px; text-align: left"&gt;新株予約権の目的となる株式の種類、内容及び数（株）　(注)５&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 408px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 8px; line-height: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 8px; text-align: left"&gt;普通株式 41,213,500&lt;/p&gt;
